s (T4-T9) gives me maximum flexibility to form multiple melds and potentially achieve Half Flush (6 points) or better. The B2 tile has no synergy with my existing meld [T1-T2-T3] or my hand tiles, while maintaining the Bamboo concentration improves my chances of forming a winning hand with good scoring patterns.\n\nAnswer: Play B2"}
