rong Bamboo suit concentration (T4 pung + potential T5-T6-T7 and T7-T8-T9 chows). Discarding it maintains maximum flexibility to complete a Half Flush pattern or pure Bamboo hand, while keeping options open for multiple winning combinations. The other tiles (especially T4x3, T7x2, and connecting Bamboo tiles) have much higher synergy.\n\nAnswer: Play J3"}
